      "statusChangeNewStatus": "needs more information",
      "value": "Hi! We're using the main [symbol](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Metre) for the unit of measurement here. Could you share more info on the use case that you have for this? I'm not too familiar with cyrilic script.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
